     "name": "Anthony Beauvillier",
     "description": "In an elimination Game 6 of the Eastern Conference Final against the Tampa Bay Lightning, Anthony Beauvillier delivered a clutch moment to keep the Islanders\u2019 playoff hopes alive, igniting the home crowd. Capitalizing on a Lightning turnover near the net, Beauvillier wasted no time, rifling a shot top shelf for his fifth goal of the playoffs and his first-ever postseason overtime winner. While the Islanders' journey ended in Game 7, Beauvillier's heroics in Game 6 remain a shining memory of their resilient run.\r\n\r\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
